{"unit_id":"JohnWes7__ds-notify-plugin#card-zh","repo":"JohnWes7/ds-notify-plugin","commit":"3052a2d7eb4b2108504a723941809a931103a35e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"ds-notify-plugin 是 DSH 的 Windows 桌面通知插件：主对话每轮结束时弹出 Windows 系统 toast，并可显示当前会话标题。它通过监听 agent/status 空闲事件并筛选根对话，再用 1.5 秒防抖合并连续信号，调用系统 PowerShell 和 WinRT 展示通知。标题尚未生成时会使用固定提示；非 Windows 平台不启用。适合希望离开屏幕时仍能知道长时间生成何时完成的 DSH 用户。安装后无需额外密钥或第三方依赖。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:108-155","lib/index.js:86-105"]}
{"unit_id":"JohnWes7__ds-notify-plugin#card-en","repo":"JohnWes7/ds-notify-plugin","commit":"3052a2d7eb4b2108504a723941809a931103a35e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"ds-notify-plugin shows a Windows toast when a DSH main conversation finishes. It filters root-agent idle events, merges bursts over 1.5 seconds, and uses PowerShell and WinRT. The toast includes the session title when available. Windows only; no key or extra dependency.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:108-155","lib/index.js:86-105"]}
