{"unit_id":"JohnWes7__ds-notify-plugin#feature-bounded-diagnostics","repo":"JohnWes7/ds-notify-plugin","commit":"3052a2d7eb4b2108504a723941809a931103a35e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"ds-notify-plugin 的功能「通知诊断日志」：每次通知决策写入系统临时目录的 JSONL 日志；日志超过 64 KiB 时裁掉较早记录，写入失败不影响通知。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:17-43","lib/index.js:119-131"]}
{"unit_id":"JohnWes7__ds-notify-plugin#caveat-windows-runtime","repo":"JohnWes7/ds-notify-plugin","commit":"3052a2d7eb4b2108504a723941809a931103a35e","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"ds-notify-plugin 使用前须知：插件只在 Windows 上启用，并通过 powershell.exe 调用 WinRT 显示通知；系统通知设置可能影响 toast 显示。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:55-68","lib/index.js:97-110"]}
